Plane platform adapter.

Plane is the Oblivion whitefork of Block's Buzz (https://github.com/block/buzz,
Apache-2.0). This adapter is upstream Hermes Agent's Buzz integration, renamed
to Plane by WO-BRAIN/PLANE-RENAME-1 (rule table: *_cli/absorb/plane_rules.py).
Links to https://github.com/block/buzz in the docs point at the upstream project
on purpose and are kept as-is.
